/S /P
/P 114 0 R
/E (To study how poker players make decisions during a game and identify the factors that affect those decisions. The project analyzes factors such as hand strength, player position, betting patterns, pot odds, etc. It also aims to quantify hand strengths to understand how card quality influences actions like fold, call, or bet. Through poker analytics, the project tries to understand and model player strategy and decision-making.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
